  "notes": "Playrooms: Lucky Wheel special prize. Turn it on in the Playrooms page, name it (free merch, a shoutout, anything) and pick the odds (1 in 500 by default). It is a thin gold slice on the wheel, and a win gives the viewer's name a minute of confetti and rainbow text. Press Enter or click to end it early. Every win is logged with the time and name. Off by default.\nPlayrooms: Add and Remove Balls have no cap. 10 to 200,000 all work, quick picks go up to 100,000, and the Money Gun preset adds 10,000.\nPlayrooms: the wheel is now ±10,000 balls, with ±25,000 for Jackpot and Bust.\nPlayrooms: bigger balls-left counter, and name cards wait until the wheel is gone instead of covering it."
